        "kind": "FROZEN_TEMPLATE",
        "html": "<article class=\"vrpt-report\" data-visual-batch=\"BAZI-DYNAMIC-R1-BATCH-01\" data-frozen-intro=\"P06\" lang=\"en\"><section class=\"vrpt-page\"  data-page-number=\"6\" data-master=\"M03\"><header data-part=\"chrome\"><div><strong>P H I O S</strong><small>HUMAN POTENTIAL INTELLIGENCE</small></div><span>BAZI · FULL REPORT</span></header><div class=\"vrpt-heading\"><div><small>STRUCTURAL</small><h2><span>Your BaZi Snapshot</span></h2><p>What is the starting structure of this reading?</p></div></div><div data-part=\"page-body\"><figure class=\"vrpt-primary\"><section class=\"vrpt-tile\" ><h3>Four pillars</h3><div data-part=\"snapshot\"><div data-part=\"pillars\"><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-selected=\"false\"><h4>Year</h4><small>Heavenly stem</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"EARTH\">己</b><span>JI · Yin</span><strong data-element=\"EARTH\">Earth</strong><hr><small>Earthly branch</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"FIRE\">巳</b><span>SI</span><strong data-element=\"FIRE\">Fire</strong></article><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-selected=\"false\"><h4>Month</h4><small>Heavenly stem</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"METAL\">庚</b><span>GENG · Yang</span><strong data-element=\"METAL\">Metal</strong><hr><small>Earthly branch</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"FIRE\">午</b><span>WU</span><strong data-element=\"FIRE\">Fire</strong></article><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-selected=\"true\"><h4>Day</h4><small>Heavenly stem</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"WATER\">癸</b><span>GUI · Yin</span><strong data-element=\"WATER\">Water</strong><hr><small>Earthly branch</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"EARTH\">丑</b><span>CHOU</span><strong data-element=\"EARTH\">Earth</strong></article><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-selected=\"false\"><h4>Hour</h4><small>Heavenly stem</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"EARTH\">戊</b><span>WU · Yang</span><strong data-element=\"EARTH\">Earth</strong><hr><small>Earthly branch</small><b data-glyph data-element=\"FIRE\">午</