part=\"bars\"><div data-element=\"EARTH\"><span>Earth</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 160 12\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Earth: 7 / 18\"><rect data-track width=\"160\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\"/><rect width=\"62.22222222222222\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><strong>7</strong></div><div data-element=\"FIRE\"><span>Fire</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 160 12\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fire: 6 / 18\"><rect data-track width=\"160\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\"/><rect width=\"53.333333333333336\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><strong>6</strong></div><div data-element=\"METAL\"><span>Metal</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 160 12\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Metal: 3 / 18\"><rect data-track width=\"160\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\"/><rect width=\"26.666666666666668\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><strong>3</strong></div><div data-element=\"WATER\"><span>Water</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 160 12\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Water: 2 / 18\"><rect data-track width=\"160\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\"/><rect width=\"17.77777777777778\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><strong>2</strong></div><div data-element=\"WOOD\"><span>Wood</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 160 12\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Wood: 0 / 18\"><rect data-track width=\"160\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\"/><rect width=\"0\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><strong>0</strong></div><small>Count / total inventory: 18</small></div></div></section><figcaption>Unweighted inventory count</figcaption></figure><div class=\"vrpt-insights\"><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-card-type=\"PRIMARY_INSIGHT\"><small>Structure</small><p>GUI · water Day Master.</p></article><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-card-type=\"CONDITION\"><small>Condition</small><p>Final strength remains open.</p></article><article class=\"vrpt-tile\" data-card-type=\"OPEN_QUESTION\"><small>Observe</small><p>Compare the structure with lived observations.</p></article></div></div><aside class=\"vrpt-boundary\">Unw